  "scope": "One fresh local Kind v0.32.0 / Kubernetes v1.36.1 cluster with Cilium 1.20.5 and its embedded Hubble observer. Three case-owned namespaces represent training, inference, and pipeline. Only fixed-marker IPv4 TCP/18080 requests between the training client and the two case-owned responders are examined. The red phase runs without NetworkPolicy; the green phase applies default deny and permits training to pipeline while denying training to inference. A named synthetic segment rule labels the training-to-inference flow as expected-denied and reports whether authentic Hubble telemetry agrees. No production workloads, external destinations, packet capture, model/data inspection, SIEM, baseline learning, or production anomaly detection are evaluated.",
